00:32:16,400 --> 00:32:17,760
But she chose instead

887
00:32:17,760 --> 00:32:19,440
(Sun Qimeng: Knows when to let go)
to let herself move on,

888
00:32:19,440 --> 00:32:20,480
and bravely face her feelings,

889
00:32:20,480 --> 00:32:21,840
then bravely

890
00:32:21,840 --> 00:32:22,520
say goodbye to them.

891
00:32:22,520 --> 00:32:23,920
She gave herself closure,

892
00:32:23,920 --> 00:32:25,760
rather than

893
00:32:25,760 --> 00:32:26,560
trying to bring

894
00:32:26,560 --> 00:32:28,800
the two of them to an end.

895
00:32:29,840 --> 00:32:30,360
Actually,

896
00:32:30,360 --> 00:32:31,360
throughout all this,

897
00:32:31,360 --> 00:32:33,920
I saw what was special between them.

898
00:32:33,920 --> 00:32:34,600
They're both the type

899
00:32:34,600 --> 00:32:36,120
(Sun Qimeng & Zhao Xilun: Brave in love)
to give their all for love.

900
00:32:36,120 --> 00:32:37,400
I think in love,
the one who takes the initiative

901
00:32:37,400 --> 00:32:38,280
is actually

902
00:32:38,560 --> 00:32:39,160
the one who

903
00:32:39,160 --> 00:32:40,280
experiences love

904
00:32:40,280 --> 00:32:41,760
more deeply.

905
00:32:41,760 --> 00:32:42,240
Meng

906
00:32:42,240 --> 00:32:44,280
has such a strong sense of self.

907
00:32:44,560 --> 00:32:45,920
But suddenly,

908
00:32:45,920 --> 00:32:47,000
as a viewer,

909
00:32:47,680 --> 00:32:48,840
I feel a little sad.

910
00:32:49,360 --> 00:32:51,000
I really wanted to see her

911
00:32:51,000 --> 00:32:51,960
