It's over when it's over.

924
00:33:07,880 --> 00:33:09,160
All we can do

925
00:33:09,160 --> 00:33:09,880
is truly

926
00:33:10,240 --> 00:33:12,040
wish them both the best.

927
00:33:12,040 --> 00:33:13,720
And I hope Meng

928
00:33:13,720 --> 00:33:14,680
finds someone

929
00:33:14,680 --> 00:33:16,700
(Best Wishes for Sun Qimeng)
who will cherish her.

930
00:33:17,040 --> 00:33:18,320
And I also hope

931
00:33:18,320 --> 00:33:19,040
Zhao Xilun can

932
00:33:19,040 --> 00:33:20,800
keep being brave,

933
00:33:20,800 --> 00:33:23,400
because he's a great person as well.

934
00:33:23,400 --> 00:33:26,400
All right, let's watch the next date.

935
00:33:26,400 --> 00:33:27,480
Here we go.

936
00:33:30,440 --> 00:33:31,600
Time to play tennis.

937
00:33:33,900 --> 00:33:36,580
(Thinking)

938
00:33:48,180 --> 00:33:49,660
(Pauses)

939
00:33:50,840 --> 00:33:51,480
He looks gloomy.

940
00:33:59,280 --> 00:33:59,720
