952
00:34:31,800 --> 00:34:33,160
It's okay. I'm not that good either.

953
00:34:33,520 --> 00:34:34,320
How should we do this?

954
00:34:34,320 --> 00:34:34,880
Let's give it a try.

955
00:34:34,880 --> 00:34:36,240
We'll just be two beginners
