966
00:35:01,600 --> 00:35:02,000
Okay.

967
00:35:02,920 --> 00:35:03,320
Come on.

968
00:35:04,280 --> 00:35:06,440
Let's move this over.

969
00:35:07,960 --> 00:35:08,920
