Okay, come on.

974
00:35:24,160 --> 00:35:24,600
Okay.

975
00:35:26,760 --> 00:35:27,600
This is how I learned it.

976
00:35:27,840 --> 00:35:28,240
You just...

977
00:35:29,360 --> 00:35:29,800
You just...

978
00:35:36,960 --> 00:35:37,280
First,

979
00:35:37,760 --> 00:35:38,520
