Right.

985
00:35:48,120 --> 00:35:50,360
Then rotate from your waist
to generate power.

986
00:35:52,160 --> 00:35:53,080
Let me try. Come on.

987
00:35:55,120 --> 00:35:55,880
And then,

988
00:35:55,880 --> 00:35:56,840
