Rotate, then swing.

997
00:36:32,480 --> 00:36:34,240
Your elbow needs to go farther back.

998
00:36:35,040 --> 00:36:35,560
Right here.

999
00:36:38,680 --> 00:36:39,520
Let's give it a try.

1000
00:36:39,520 --> 00:36:40,320
