1016
00:37:04,040 --> 00:37:05,680
Don't use just your arm.

1017
00:37:06,360 --> 00:37:06,880
Okay?

1018
00:37:06,880 --> 00:37:07,240
Okay.

1019
00:37:07,880 --> 00:37:08,280
Okay.

1020
00:37:13,280 --> 00:37:14,720
Are you planning to hit me
like that later?

1021
00:37:15,280 --> 00:37:15,720
No.

1022
00:37:17,480 --> 00:37:18,600
