1023
00:37:20,040 --> 00:37:20,560
Take it slow.

1024
00:37:20,560 --> 00:37:21,240
Let's take it slow.

1025
00:37:21,920 --> 00:37:22,240
Okay.

1026
00:37:22,240 --> 00:37:22,840
Otherwise,

1027
00:37:22,840 --> 00:37:24,040
