1052
00:38:01,560 --> 00:38:01,960
Exactly.

1053
00:38:01,960 --> 00:38:03,240
You should be practicing with me,

1054
00:38:03,240 --> 00:38:03,920
not the other way around.

1055
00:38:04,020 --> 00:38:04,700
(Praise*3)

1056
00:38:05,240 --> 00:38:06,120
I don't know how to play at all.

1057
00:38:10,160 --> 00:38:11,160
You're a natural.

1058
