1064
00:38:19,080 --> 00:38:20,760
It's like a cat teaching a tiger.

1065
00:38:21,120 --> 00:38:23,980
It's like a cat teaching a tiger.

1066
00:38:24,200 --> 00:38:25,240
What? Don't...

1067
00:38:28,280 --> 00:38:29,480
So happy.

1068
00:38:29,960 --> 00:38:31,840
"Don't flatter me."

1069
00:38:32,040 --> 00:38:32,960
What? Don't...

1070
00:38:36,000 --> 00:38:37,400
Let's pick up these balls first, okay?

1071
00:38:37,400 --> 00:38:37,960
Okay.

1072
00:38:39,440 --> 00:38:40,920
Picking up balls is actually pretty fun.

1073
00:38:41,320 --> 00:38:42,560
