1126
00:40:39,920 --> 00:40:40,200
So sweet.

1127
00:40:40,200 --> 00:40:41,120
I love this kind of thing.

1128
00:40:41,600 --> 00:40:42,400
If I were a guy,

1129
00:40:42,400 --> 00:40:43,680
