I get it now.

1131
00:40:45,760 --> 00:40:47,800
Even girls can't resist her.

1132
00:40:48,440 --> 00:40:49,520
Let's take a break.

1133
00:40:50,040 --> 00:40:50,960
These flowers are for you.

1134
00:40:54,760 --> 00:40:55,560
Thank you.

1135
00:41:00,040 --> 00:41:00,640
Thank you.

1136
00:41:00,920 --> 00:41:02,000
He's getting shy.

1137
00:41:02,160 --> 00:41:03,360
They look delicious.

1138
00:41:03,360 --> 00:41:04,440
They look delicious?

1139
00:41:04,440 --> 00:41:05,200
Like ice cream.

1140
00:41:06,120 --> 00:41:07,320
