Pretty good.

1273
00:44:55,920 --> 00:44:56,360
That's good.

1274
00:44:56,360 --> 00:44:57,240
I'm in a great mood.

1275
00:44:57,840 --> 00:44:58,840
I'm in a great mood.

1276
