1336
00:47:12,040 --> 00:47:12,760
Restructuring?

1337
00:47:12,760 --> 00:47:13,200
Yeah.

1338
00:47:13,480 --> 00:47:15,480
Big tech companies

1339
00:47:16,320 --> 00:47:18,600
