1364
00:48:07,140 --> 00:48:07,720
Oh my gosh.

1365
00:48:07,920 --> 00:48:08,560
That's awful.

1366
00:48:08,710 --> 00:48:09,160
Oh my gosh.

1367
00:48:09,160 --> 00:48:09,840
So you...

1368
00:48:24,040 --> 00:48:24,640
So,

1369
00:48:24,640 --> 00:48:26,720
