1395
00:49:22,600 --> 00:49:24,520
I have to deal with anxiety too.

1396
00:49:25,400 --> 00:49:26,400
We're all ordinary people.

1397
00:49:26,760 --> 00:49:28,040
We're really all the same.

1398
00:49:28,040 --> 00:49:29,480
I think courage is simply

1399
00:49:29,480 --> 00:49:30,560
