Being brave doesn't mean
you're not afraid.

1401
00:49:34,900 --> 00:49:36,460
(Fidgets)

1402
00:49:37,220 --> 00:49:38,720
I'm scared every day,

1403
00:49:38,720 --> 00:49:40,680
