1408
00:49:48,320 --> 00:49:49,280
Wow.

1409
00:49:49,280 --> 00:49:49,920
That's amazing.

1410
00:49:56,840 --> 00:49:59,240
I need to do what I believe is right.

1411
00:49:59,240 --> 00:50:00,160
So I have to

1412
